https://ojsull.webs.ull.es/,Licencia mencionada (ver comentarios),DEPENDE,"El uso está permitido siempre que se cumplan los términos de atribución, no uso comercial y licencia compartida (ShareAlike), pero está prohibido para fines comerciales según la cláusula ""NonCommercial"".","[{""categoria"": null, ""via"": ""rel_license"", ""url_origen"": ""https://ojsull.webs.ull.es/"", ""markdown_path"": null, ""texto_inline"": ""[Skip to content](#main-content-marker)\n\n\nLanguages available\n\naragonés\n\nAzərbaycanca\n\nBahasa Indonesia\n\nBasque\n\ncatalà\n\ndansk\n\nDeutsch\n\neesti\n\nEnglish\n\nespañol\n\nEsperanto\n\nfrançais\n\nfrysk\n\nGaeilge\n\ngalego\n\nHrvatski\n\nitaliano\n\nlatviešu\n\nLietuviškai\n\nMagyar\n\nMelayu\n\nNederlands\n\nnorsk\n\npolski\n\nPortuguês\n\nPortuguês Brasileiro\n\nRomână\n\nSlovensky\n\nSlovenščina\n\nsrpski (latinica)\n\nsuomi\n\nsvenska\n\nTürkçe\n\nÍslenska\n\nčesky\n\nΕλληνικά\n\nбеларуская\n\nбългарски\n\nРусский\n\nУкраїнська\n\nالعربيّة\n\nفارسی\n\nहिंदी\n\nবাংলা\n\n日本語\n\n简体中文\n\n繁體中文\n\n한국어\n\n\n\n## Canonical URL\n\n<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/>\n\n[See the legal code](legalcode.en)\n\n## You are free to:\n\n1. **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any\n   medium or format\n2. **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the\n   material\n3. The licensor cannot revoke these freedoms as long as you follow\n   the license terms.\n\n## Under the following terms:\n\n1. **Attribution** — You must give\n   [appropriate credit](#ref-appropriate-credit), provide a link to the license, and\n   [indicate if changes were made](#ref-indicate-changes). You may do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that\n   suggests the licensor endorses you or your use.\n2. **NonCommercial** — You may not use the material for\n   [commercial purposes](#ref-commercial-purposes).\n3. **ShareAlike** — If you remix, transform, or build\n   upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under\n   th